{"type":"block","data":{"id":"arestext2000000000000000000","parentId":"arescard2000000000000000000","rootId":"bres00000000000000000000000","createdBy":"system","modifiedBy":"system","schema":1,"type":"text","title":"## What is needed\nGather the options we are choosing between and compare them on what matters to us: price, limitations, what we would have to change on our side.\n\nPut a comparison table and a page with the conclusion into the folder: what we take and why.\n\n## Important\nMark the debatable points separately and say what was missing to decide.","fields":{},"createAt":1785888000000,"updateAt":1785888000000,"deleteAt":0}}
