{"type":"block","data":{"id":"arestext3000000000000000000","parentId":"arescard3000000000000000000","rootId":"bres00000000000000000000000","createdBy":"system","modifiedBy":"system","schema":1,"type":"text","title":"## What is needed\nThere are articles, extracts and notes in the folder. Read them and write up a summary: what this is about, what matters, what contradicts what.\n\nOne page, with links to the files each part came from.","fields":{},"createAt":1785888000000,"updateAt":1785888000000,"deleteAt":0}}
